From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FerrionOS contributors <contributors@ferrion.invalid>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:08:00 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] backend: Pace ferrion-wm frames with page flips and log GL renderer (GP8)

Open ferrion-wm-backend with PresentPreference::PageFlip so the display
presenter selects PAGE_FLIP when the display driver supports it and
keeps DIRTYFB otherwise. Pace redraws on BackendEvent::FlipComplete
returning to Pacing::Idle, deliver presentation feedback using the DRM
flip event's CLOCK_MONOTONIC timestamp (tv_us) with Kind::HwCompletion
only (ADR 0032), log FERRION_RENDERER and FERRION_PRESENTER at startup,
and append mode, composite_us, sync_wait_us, copy_us, readback_us and
present_us to FERRION_FRAME.
